{"title":"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Randy drove the first third of his trip on a gravel road, the next <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> miles on pavement, and the remaining one-fifth on a dirt road. In miles, how long was Randy's trip?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/4/6541aeb25f46a8e07b63d646651f98eaea01995d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf {(A) } 30 \\qquad \\textbf {(B) } \\frac{400}{11} \\qquad \\textbf {(C) } \\frac{75}{2} \\qquad \\textbf {(D) } 40 \\qquad \\textbf {(E) } \\frac{300}{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"427\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the total distance be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/0/120bc60fb05702b5f989fba99bf1c6aedcf288e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{x}{3} + 20 + \\dfrac{x}{5} = x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"125\" height=\"33\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/4/f540442dce44becd92df064d0f21f83ea47b8c79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{8x}{15} + 20 = x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"98\" height=\"38\" />. Subtracting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/9/b098af65cc6f269b02c746938ad41b9e3f3bf018.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{8x}{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"21\" height=\"38\" /> from both sides gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/9/c89364b56cf2b2454dedc3c16ee37f98ed0c1db1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20 = \\dfrac{7x}{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"64\" height=\"37\" />. Multiplying by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/a/efa59c4f840ff2b6bca1b50a54da6975fe418db5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{15}{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" /> gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/b/09b4ec1076bd600e934c579392b06308dc6421b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\boxed{{\\textbf{(E) }\\dfrac{300}{7}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"113\" height=\"49\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The first third of his distance added to the last one-fifth of his distance equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/a/c8af5c320b8a5428aae3f0e36bc40cec6fd82b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{8}{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"38\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/3/3e319760cc6a563288cfbd630e0715b23ed67d86.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{7}{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" /> of his distance is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be his total distance, and solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/6/11636281438044260ddec6f2f2bc78f81524f01c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{300}{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"29\" height=\"37\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28CREATIVE_THINKING.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Aaa8O3ko6pQ\">https://youtu.be/Aaa8O3ko6pQ</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/C4zRNsTVMtY\">https://youtu.be/C4zRNsTVMtY</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</sp